<header class="dev-hero">
    <div class="container dev-hero-inner">
        <div class="dev-hero-copy">
            <p class="term-eyebrow"><span class="term-prompt">&gt;</span> /desarrollo-software</p>
            <h1>Software a tu medida, sin sorpresas en la entrega.</h1>
            <p class="hero-subtitle">
                Diseñamos, construimos y entregamos sistemas web y móviles con un
                proceso transparente: sabes qué se construye cada semana y a qué
                costo.
            </p>
            <div class="hero-cta">
                <a
                    href="https://calendar.app.google/4occ12N5XGe6aqYf8"
                    target="_blank"
                    class="btn-primary">Agendar reunión de 15/30 min.</a
                >
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="dev-panel" aria-hidden="true">
            <div class="dev-panel-head">
                <span>Construyendo v1.0</span>
                <span class="dev-live"><i class="fas fa-circle"></i> en progreso</span>
            </div>

            <div class="dev-log">
                <p class="dev-log-line" style="--d: 0s;"><span class="dev-ok">$</span> bgm build --release-v1</p>
                <p class="dev-log-line" style="--d: 0.4s;"><span class="dev-ok">&#10003;</span> scaffolding del proyecto</p>
                <p class="dev-log-line" style="--d: 0.8s;"><span class="dev-ok">&#10003;</span> componentes core</p>
                <p class="dev-log-line" style="--d: 1.2s;"><span class="dev-info">&#8594;</span> 42 de 120 tareas completadas</p>
                <p class="dev-log-line dev-cursor" style="--d: 1.6s;">
                    <span class="dev-ok">$</span><span class="dev-cursor-bar"></span>
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="dev-wire">
                <span class="dev-note dev-note-w">12px gutter</span>
                <span class="dev-note dev-note-h">50% hero</span>
                <div class="dev-wire-bar">
                    <span class="dev-frame-dots"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span>
                    <span class="dev-frame-url">bgm-solutions.cl/app</span>
                </div>
                <div class="dev-wire-nav">
                    <span class="dev-skel" style="width: 90px;"></span>
                    <span class="dev-skel dev-skel-dim" style="width: 26px;"></span>
                </div>
                <div class="dev-wire-body">
                    <div class="dev-wire-copy">
                        <span class="dev-skel" style="width: 82%; height: 20px;"></span>
                        <span class="dev-skel dev-skel-dim" style="width: 62%; height: 12px;"></span>
                        <span class="dev-skel dev-skel-dim" style="width: 46%; height: 12px;"></span>
                        <span class="dev-skel dev-skel-accent" style="width: 120px; height: 34px;"></span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="dev-wire-frame">
                        <span class="dev-skel dev-skel-img"></span>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="dev-wire-cards">
                    <span class="dev-skel dev-skel-card"></span>
                    <span class="dev-skel dev-skel-card"></span>
                    <span class="dev-skel dev-skel-card"></span>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</header>